# apps/api/drizzle/ is COMMITTED, not ignored. It is now real versioned
# migration history (`db:generate` writes a reviewed .sql + meta/_journal.json,
# `db:migrate` applies them in order). It was ignored back when the workflow
# was `drizzle-kit push`, which diffed the live database and never wrote these
# files at all — so what was there was generated output, not history.
# Drizzle's meta/*.json snapshots are required for it to diff the NEXT change.
